USER
 ↓
TASK
 ↓
TRACE START
 ↓
BRAIN
 ↓
SKILL
 ↓
TOOL
 ↓
PLUGIN
 ↓
MODEL
 ↓
EXECUTION
 ↓
OBSERVABILITY
 ↓
